  "sourceTitle": "Fantastic Meatloaf",
  "sourceText": "Fantastic Meatloaf\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 11:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n6 slices bacon\n2 lbs. ground beef\n1 cup bread crumbs\n1 lg. onion, chopped\n1 egg\n1 1/2 teaspoons salt\n1/4 teaspoon pepper\n4 tablespoons catsup\n1/2 cup milk\n4 tablespoons vinegar\n4 tablespoons brown sugar\n2 tablespoons Worcestershire sauce\n1/2 cup catsup\n1/4 chopped onion\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place bacon slices on bottom of pan. Combine loaf ingredients; put on top of bacon. Bake for 1 hour uncovered at 350 degrees. 2 Combine, bring to a boil and simmer. Baste loaf while cooking until sauce is gone. Serves 6-8.",
