        "text": "1 Place bacon slices on bottom of pan. Combine loaf ingredients; put on top of bacon. Bake for 1 hour uncovered at 350 degrees. 2 Combine, bring to a boil and simmer. Baste loaf while cooking until sauce is gone. Serves 6-8."
